### Important Issues (N items)
...

### Minor Issues (N items)
...

### Patterns Observed
- [Recurring themes across findings]

### Recommendations
1. [Highest priority action]
2. ...

### Next Steps
- [ ] [Suggested next action]
- [ ] [Alternative direction]
```

